 "insight": [
  "The main changes in Luxembourg's trade with Japan and China between 2005 and 2025 show strong growth in exports of Electrical machinery and equipment, which increased from 10.7 million euros to 33.1 million euros.",
  "The largest export increase was in Optical, measuring and medical instruments, rising from 677 thousand euros to 10.6 million euros.",
  "Imports of Electrical machinery and equipment also grew significantly, from 246.3 million euros to 768.9 million euros, while imports of Machinery and mechanical appliances decreased from 2.08 billion euros to 1.03 billion euros.",
  "These values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, which may affect the interpretation of growth over time."
 ],
